{"id":"n55485-1-10","stage":3,"title":"대통령 · 总统","scene":"制度与公共事务","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55485-1-10-1","ko":"이번 선거에 누구를 대통령으로 뽑을 거야?","zh":"这次选举你要选谁当总统呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"선거에","meaning":"选举","explanation":"선거：选举；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"선거","audio":"/audio/c091c2a2a2efa68e985a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16617","senseId":"1","lemma":"선거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"누구를","meaning":"谁都，无论是谁","explanation":"누구：谁都，无论是谁；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"2","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"대통령으로","meaning":"总统","explanation":"대통령：总统；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"대통령","audio":"/audio/d24e93bf93af1f390b1e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55485","senseId":"1","lemma":"대통령","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뽑을","meaning":"选拔，选","explanation":"뽑다：选拔，选；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"뽑다","audio":"/audio/8fe05f49afd4379ae870.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26962","senseId":"4","lemma":"뽑다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"c091c2a2a2efa68e","term":"선거","zh":"选举","audio":"/audio/c091c2a2a2efa68e985a.mp3","entryId":"16617","definition":"在一定的组织或集团内通过投票挑选代表或管理人员。","pronunciation":["선ː거"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁都，无论是谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指尚未确定的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"d24e93bf93af1f39","term":"대통령","zh":"总统","audio":"/audio/d24e93bf93af1f390b1e.mp3","entryId":"55485","definition":"实行总统制政体的共和国里被选为国家元首和行政首脑的官员；或指该地位。","pronunciation":["대ː통녕"]},{"id":"8fe05f49afd4379a","term":"뽑다","zh":"选拔，选","audio":"/audio/8fe05f49afd4379ae870.mp3","entryId":"26962","definition":"为某个目标而选出。","pronunciation":["뽑따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/1643c9978abd10b21a47.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n55485-1-10-2","ko":"음, 후보들 공약을 들어본 다음에 정하려고.","zh":"嗯，打算先听听各位候选人的竞选承诺后再做决定。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"음,","meaning":"嘿","explanation":"음：嘿","readings":[{"term":"음","audio":"/audio/95e3c75cd502220bd32f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71111","senseId":"2","lemma":"음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"후보들","meaning":"候选人","explanation":"후보：候选人；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"후보","audio":"/audio/7baf75f51c9d0d7daeae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88102","senseId":"1","lemma":"후보","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"공약을","meaning":"承诺","explanation":"공약：承诺；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"공약","audio":"/audio/4f94034fa7f712410414.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19428","senseId":"1","lemma":"공약","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어본","meaning":"听说；试，试图","explanation":"듣다：听说；보다：试，试图；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"},{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"4","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다음에","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정하려고.","meaning":"下决心，立志","explanation":"정하다：下决心，立志；려고：非敬语地表达打算，或根据语调询问意图。","readings":[{"term":"정하다","audio":"/audio/2b712f8bfe2006ebd91d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29767","senseId":"2","lemma":"정하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"95e3c75cd502220b","term":"음","zh":"嘿","audio":"/audio/95e3c75cd502220bd32f.mp3","entryId":"71111","definition":"不满意或担心时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["음"]},{"id":"7baf75f51c9d0d7d","term":"후보","zh":"候选人","audio":"/audio/7baf75f51c9d0d7daeae.mp3","entryId":"88102","definition":"在选举中，为得到某个职位或身份，具备一定资格后参加选举；或指这种人。","pronunciation":["후보"]},{"id":"4f94034fa7f71241","term":"공약","zh":"承诺","audio":"/audio/4f94034fa7f712410414.mp3","entryId":"19428","definition":"政府、政党、候选人等向民众保证以后要做什么事；或那种保证。","pronunciation":["공약"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听说","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"接收他人口头上的传达内容。","pronunciation":["듣따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试，试图","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"表示试着做前面所指的行为。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"以后，下次","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"一段时间后。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"2b712f8bfe2006eb","term":"정하다","zh":"下决心，立志","audio":"/audio/2b712f8bfe2006ebd91d.mp3","entryId":"29767","definition":"心意或意志变坚定。","pronunciation":["정ː하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/dbfcfa1517e376f863d7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.182,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=55485","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https